A \emph{sub-measurement}
is a set of Hermitian, positive-semidefinite matrices
$A = \{A_a\}_{a \in \calA}$
acting on~$\calH$
such that $\sum_a A_a \leq I$.
The sub-measurement is \emph{projective} if $(A_a)^2 = A_a$ for each~$a$.
It is a \emph{measurement}

